    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67325" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆδος</span></b>  (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>,
			τό, 
			Ep.
		 Noun, only pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήδεα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>genitals</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
